5,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I intend to observe everyone's reactions and speech patterns. I will only commit to a conclusion once the probability of a player being the werewolf is sufficiently high.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm just excited to play with everyone! I think we can find the werewolf if we just trust each other and stay positive. Let's do our best!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Logic is our only weapon here. We should focus on inconsistencies in statements and behavioral shifts. Emotional appeals are often a mask for deception.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will rely on verified data and objective evidence. Intuition is unreliable; we must guide the group toward the truth using a rational assessment of the facts.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! This is like a big mystery game! I'm going to watch everyone closely and see who's acting weird. I'll follow the smartest people!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, I agree. Behavioral patterns are key. I'll be looking for those who try too hard to lead or those who are suspiciously quiet.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, that sounds a bit scary! But I'll help you look! I'm sure we can all get along while we figure this out.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, exactly. However, we must also be careful not to mistake nervousness for guilt. A logical framework prevents us from making premature accusations.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I will maintain a stoic approach. By removing emotion from the equation, we can better identify the contradictions that the werewolf will inevitably create.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Ryuji, you sound so serious! Hehe, maybe you're the one hiding something? Just kidding! I'll be looking for clues like a little detective!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, your spontaneity might be useful, but let's ensure we don't let the discussion drift into chaos. Structure is necessary for a correct deduction.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I think it's okay to have fun! If we're happy, we'll think better, right? I'll support whoever is trying their hardest to help the village!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"While positivity is pleasant, @Kenji, it can be a blind spot. We should prioritize the verification of claims over the comfort of the group.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with Mizuki. The goal is the elimination of the werewolf, not social harmony. I will focus on the evidence provided by the game's mechanics.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I'll be the bridge! I'll listen to the serious people and the happy people and see who feels the most honest. That's my secret method!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Toshio,,"I have heard everyone's approach. I will remain in the background for now, analyzing the flow of information.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm ready for the night! Good luck everyone, and let's keep our friendship strong no matter what happens!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will be observing how each of you handles the information revealed tomorrow. The first few reactions are usually the most telling.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I have a clear plan. I will process the data I receive and use it to steer the village toward a logical conclusion.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm so excited! I hope I can find a big clue tomorrow! Goodnight everyone, don't let the werewolf eat you!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
