66,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Kenji is gone. The fact that Ryuji was attacked suggests the werewolf viewed the Seer as the greatest threat. This increases the probability that Ryuji is the Seer.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Or, the werewolf attacked Ryuji to make him look like the Seer, thereby manipulating Toshio into trusting him more. We must consider the possibility of a frame-up.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh no! Ryuji was attacked! That's so scary! But he's still here, right? Wait, he's not speaking... oh, he's gone!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"Ryuji is dead. We have lost our primary source of information. We are now left with Mizuki, Sakura, and myself. One of us is the werewolf.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"With the Seer gone, the werewolf will likely try to blend in by agreeing with the most dominant voice. @Toshio, you have been very analytical.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"I'm scared! I don't want to be the only one left with a werewolf! Mizuki, you're the smartest, can you tell who it is?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, intelligence does not guarantee the truth. Mizuki has been consistently logical, which is a perfect cover for a werewolf or a Possessed player.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, your suspicion is a natural reaction to the loss of the Seer. However, attacking me now would be a gamble based on a ""feeling"" rather than evidence.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I don't like this! Everyone is pointing fingers! I think... I think Mizuki is too calm. It's a little bit creepy!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"Mizuki's calmness is her strength, but also her flaw. In a group of three, the one who avoids taking a definitive stand is often the one hiding.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I am simply maintaining the logical standard we agreed upon on Day 0. If you vote for me without proof, you are playing into the werewolf's hands.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm going with my tummy! My tummy says Mizuki is the one! Sorry Mizuki, but you're too scary!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
